# Web UI

**Folder:** `lib/web/` only. Runner: `web/`. Activated when `useWebShell(context)` (`kIsWeb` + viewport ≥ `WebTokens.compactBreakpoint`).

## Structure

```
lib/web/
  design/web_tokens.dart      # extends shared AppColors / AppLayout
  layout/app_layout_scope.dart
  screens/*_body.dart         # page content (no mobile scaffold)
  widgets/
    shell/                    # WebShellScaffold, WebSidebar, WebOverlayScaffold
    catalog/                  # grids, WebBookCard, hover
    reader/                   # column layout, chapter grid
    common/                   # WebPageHeader, WebSection
```

## Conventions

- Screen bodies (`HomeScreenBody`, …) — parent route adapter in `lib/screens/` picks web vs mobile vs desktop.
- Responsive tiers: `AppLayoutTier` via `AppLayoutScope`.
- Narrow web (< 720px) uses **mobile** UI — do not assume sidebar is always visible.
- Hover, multi-column grids, breadcrumb bar — web-only patterns.
- Import logic from common; never duplicate providers or API calls.

## Do / don't

```dart
// ✅ Web-only layout
return WebPageScaffold(body: HomeScreenBody());

// ❌ Do not import mobile or desktop widgets
import '../../mobile/widgets/shell/liquid_glass_nav_bar.dart';
import '../../desktop/widgets/shell/desktop_shell.dart';
```

Build: `make reader-run-web` / `make reader-build-web`.
